{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18812","headline":"和乐天讌李周美中丞宅池上赏樱桃花 · 刘禹锡","name":"和乐天讌李周美中丞宅池上赏樱桃花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱桃千万枝，照耀如雪天。\n王孙讌其下，隔水疑神仙。\n宿露发清香，初阳动暄妍。\n妖姬满髻插，酒客折枝传。\n同此赏芳月，几人有华筵。\n杯行勿遽辞，好醉逸三年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}